<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Faccetta bianca (one setting by Nicola Macedonio and Eugenio Grio)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">answer song</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Il Faccetta Nera, cocktail (Enrico Mariotti, Florence)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1938</span><span class="sg-chain-h">named after the song</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">I due nemici (The Best of Enemies), film (Guy Hamilton)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1961</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Mean Streets, film (Martin Scorsese)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1973</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Christ Stopped at Eboli, film (Francesco Rosi)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">¡Ay, Carmela!, film (Carlos Saura)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1990</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tolo Tolo, film (Checco Zalone)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2020</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li></ul></section>
